  "description": "# Busan\n\n## PUS · v0.3.1\n\nCustom map of Busan, Korea, built from official Korean government transport and demographic data.\n\n## Coverage\n\n<table style=\"width: auto\">\n<tr><td><strong>Region</strong></td><td>부산광역시, 경상남도</td></tr>\n<tr><td><strong>Playable Area</strong></td><td>1,609 km²</td></tr>\n</table>\n\n<details>\n<summary>District list (19)</summary>\n\n<table style=\"width: auto\">\n<tr><th align=\"left\">시군구</th><th align=\"left\">District</th><th align=\"right\">Population</th></tr>\n<tr><td colspan=\"3\"><strong>부산광역시</strong></td></tr>\n<tr><td>강서구</td><td>Gangseo-gu</td><td align=\"right\">149,070</td></tr>\n<tr><td>금정구</td><td>Geumjeong-gu</td><td align=\"right\">96,281</td></tr>\n<tr><td>기장군</td><td>Gijang-gun</td><td align=\"right\">175,285</td></tr>\n<tr><td>남구</td><td>Nam-gu</td><td align=\"right\">395,167</td></tr>\n<tr><td>동구</td><td>Dong-gu</td><td align=\"right\">71,311</td></tr>\n<tr><td>동래구</td><td>Dongnae-gu</td><td align=\"right\">265,023</td></tr>\n<tr><td>부산진구</td><td>Busanjin-gu</td><td align=\"right\">359,280</td></tr>\n<tr><td>북구</td><td>Buk-gu</td><td align=\"right\">190,693</td></tr>\n<tr><td>사상구</td><td>Sasang-gu</td><td align=\"right\">563,071</td></tr>\n<tr><td>사하구</td><td>Saha-gu</td><td align=\"right\">109,976</td></tr>\n<tr><td>서구</td><td>Seo-gu</td><td align=\"right\">206,095</td></tr>\n<tr><td>수영구</td><td>Suyeong-gu</td><td align=\"right\">103,732</td></tr>\n<tr><td>연제구</td><td>Yeonje-gu</td><td align=\"right\">61,069</td></tr>\n<tr><td>영도구</td><td>Yeongdo-gu</td><td align=\"right\">215,352</td></tr>\n<tr><td>중구</td><td>Jung-gu</td><td align=\"right\">394,821</td></tr>\n<tr><td>해운대구</td><td>Haeundae-gu</td><td align=\"right\">276,795</td></tr>\n<tr><td colspan=\"3\"><strong>경상남도</strong></td></tr>\n<tr><td>김해시</td><td>Gimhae-si</td><td align=\"right\">291,426</td></tr>\n<tr><td>양산시</td><td>Yangsan-si</td><td align=\"right\">229,545</td></tr>\n<tr><td>진주시</td><td>Jinju-si</td><td align=\"right\">361,984</td></tr>\n</table>\n</details>\n\n## Population Summary\n\n<table style=\"width: auto\">\n<tr><td><strong>Total Modeled Demand</strong></td><td align=\"right\">2,749,869</td></tr>\n<tr><td><strong>Pops</strong></td><td align=\"right\">44,156</td></tr>\n</table>\n\n## Additional Features\n\n- **Neighborhood Labels** — The map includes municipal and neighborhood labels derived from administrative boundary data.\n\t- 시도 (Si, Do - Metropolitan / Provincial level)\n\t- 시군구 (Si, Gun, Gu - City / County / District level)\n\t- 읍면동 (Eup, Myeon, Dong - Neighborhood level)\n\n## Data Sources\n\n- Korean Transportation Database (Korea Transport Institute, KOTI) (ktdb.go.kr)\n- V-world (Ministry of Land, Infrastructure and Transport, MOLIT) (vworld.kr)\n- Statistical Geographic Information System (SGIS) plus (Ministry of Data and Statistics, MODS) (sgis.mods.go.kr)\n- Address-based Industry Support Service (Ministry of the Interior and Safety, MOIS) (business.juso.go.kr)\n- Aviation statistics 2025 (Korea Civil Aviation Association, KCAA) (airportal.go.kr)\n- Korean railroad statistics 2024 (Korea Railroad, KORAIL) (railstat.korail.com)\n- Korean Public Transportation Database (Korea Transportation Safety Authority, KTSA) (kotsa.or.kr)\n- Korean Hospital and Pharmacy Status (Health Insurance Review and Assessment Service, HIRA) (data.go.kr)\n- Health Insurance Medical Statistics (HIRA) (opendata.hira.or.kr)\n- Academy Information System (Ministry of Education, MOE) (academyinfo.go.kr)\n\n## Credits\n\nMap authored by budhakr",
